; `&` is in no Core §2 token — not an identifier, not a keyword, not an operator,
; not a literal — so the identity anchor `(& 1 :name "x")` two documents used to
; specify was never lexable. It is deleted rather than respelled: an anchor is a
; pool entry somebody points at twice, and `:pool` already had to exist.
(& 1 :name "Orchestrator" :peers [(:ref 2)])
